==Strategy==
This stage features a variety of enemies, and you will have to prepare for all of them. [[:Category:Zombie Killer Cats|Zombie Killers]] such as [[Miyamoku Musashi (Special Cat)|Awakened Musashi]] are useful in addition to Anti-Zombie meatshields such as [[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Shigong Cat]]. Holyblast is recommended for the Cadaver Bears as without it, they can easily traverse your ground, leaving you with a gaping hole in your meatshields and putting you at a disadvantage. You can also use the Coffin Zoges to your advantage by using them as stepping stones for [[Long Distance]] units to snipe Teacher A. and the Audience Bears.

